# Camera. Follow and zoom on Play. Space switches to CamB.
node 1 OnStart
pos 1 40 80
entry OnStart 1
node 2 FindObject Player
pos 2 40 260
node 3 SetCameraTarget
pos 3 360 80
default 3 1 4
node 4 Zoom
pos 4 680 80
default 4 0 -12
node 5 OnAction jump
pos 5 40 420
entry OnAction:jump 5
node 6 SwitchCamera CamB
pos 6 360 420
exec 1 0 3
data 3 0 2 0
exec 3 0 4
exec 5 0 6
comment 20 600 1100 80 1 "Press Space to look through CamB. Press Play first."
